Package: narrativecv
Title: Map Narrative CV Sections to Evidence in Open Research Infrastructures
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Pablo", "Sánchez-Núñez", email = "psancheznunez@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7845-9506"))
Description: Applies an open, versioned crosswalk between narrative curriculum
    vitae frameworks (the Royal Society 'Résumé for Researchers' and the
    Spanish 'Currículum Vitae Abreviado' of the Agencia Estatal de
    Investigación) and the records held by 'ORCID', 'OpenAlex', 'DataCite' and
    the 'OpenAIRE' Graph. Given an 'ORCID' identifier it reports, section by
    section, the evidence found, its type, coverage and limitations, and which
    sections only the researcher's narrative can document, in support of
    responsible research assessment. The crosswalk is described in
    Sánchez-Núñez (2026) <doi:10.5281/zenodo.23881631>.
